{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_title", "source_sha256": "733dcbe6ff7f9b11409a73ce54c45f60bd61c690eddd36c4c83a245383315345", "ja": "紗代子とおでかけ2", "zh": "和纱代子外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aabde7172300ca65560a96c201752768194d44285b617079c0ced4b1d5d84cf6", "ja": "紗代子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和纱代子一起出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7322f8626d348e86bac2a6ff3befadd324c108ee5c90603134333ca2c60b344d", "ja": "（仕事の移動中、紗代子と山梨名物を食べに来た。\nなにを頼もうかな？）", "zh": "（工作途中，和纱代子一起来品尝山梨名产。\n点什么好呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "8e8c479f8cadbdc09aee3ca24abb960ba6b5f7e4ad15787ae88302430cf4fad9", "ja": "{$P$}、山梨名物、楽しみですね！\nけど、山梨名物ってどんな料理があるんでしょう？", "zh": "{$P$}，山梨名物，真让人期待呢！\n不过，山梨名物都有哪些料理呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "41fe3ad27e380b17f886ee2e915575287be2721d8446617c3ef9e2eb45ceae15", "ja": "そうだな……一番有名なのは、ほうとうかな？\nとりあえず頼んでみようか。", "zh": "是啊……最有名的应该是馎饦吧？\n总之先点来尝尝看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "eb607dfaeaca7f0fdfe77432db9edd93a5c3ec3a1257d71ef34370d361a7c8b4", "ja": "お、来た来た……おいしそうだな！　いただきます。\nほうとう、温かいな……ハフハフ。", "zh": "哦，来了来了……看起来真好吃！那我开动了。\n馎饨，热乎乎的……呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "21ca87f3fa9f88e7436520fa38b24f420fdd8511315a3cc4110723890595fbc4", "ja": "美味しい！　カボチャが入ってるせいかな？\nとっても優しい味がしますね。", "zh": "好好吃！是因为放了南瓜吗？\n味道特别温和呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "9d9dc9c490bb2e6dd9023fe9f8d0d9f8db581cf42d445e8cd1d9b36285c1a345", "ja": "郷土料理っていいなぁ……\n身も心も温まる感じがしますね♪", "zh": "地方料理真好啊……\n感觉身心都暖和起来了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d8795f7fab31981bcc980e58602cf7142c85216115fc33476ecbd1854092d32d", "ja": "そうだな……。こんなに優しい味の料理を食べたのは、\nなんだか久し振りな気がするよ……。", "zh": "是啊……感觉好久没吃到味道这么温和的料理了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "e3eee6241c6212a86c156635952d62591adb1836a50a94e11a4768b0fcdf0a5a", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？\nもしかして、仕事が忙しすぎて……？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？\n难道是因为工作太忙了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "2a23015e7bad8cb9a5d00aad474fe8b30072f144143274627a975fe94aa8d541", "ja": "……{$P$}！\nほうとう、私の分も食べてください！", "zh": "……{$P$}！\n馎饦，请把我的这份也吃了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1f3802f8a71d5516af50098728d2afd28012c1f56bd9bef8d421846dd1606f64", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だから。\n紗代子は自分の分をちゃんと食べてくれ。", "zh": "不用了，没事的。\n纱代子你自己那份要好好吃完啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "d1d92d7f37d456f706672354f1d241356d21d9e93d1b1a892cb78a292dd934e0", "ja": "そうですか……わかりました。\nけど、足りなければ追加しましょうね！", "zh": "这样啊……我知道了。\n不过，要是不够的话，再添一些吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_027say02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_027say02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "840519b79af4526bc741db0fb0aaf619be559c27510592a23ea6acc9f79c8e3f", "ja": "（ほうとうはもちろん美味しかったけど……\n紗代子の優しさで、芯まで温まった気がするな！）", "zh": "（馎饨当然很好吃……\n但感觉连心底都被纱代子的温柔给温暖了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
